        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Cytogenetic confirmation of ring chromosome 16 plus presence of growth retardation and developmental delay",
    "notes": "Phenotypic variability is common due to mosaicism and size of chromosomal deletion."
